WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:03.284
India's answer to China's
mega dam is another dam.

00:00:03.329 --> 00:00:08.269
The proposed Siang Upper Multipurpose
Project in Arunachal Pradesh is planned at

00:00:08.269 --> 00:00:10.759
around 11,200 megawatts.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.195
It could store water
and reduce flood risk.

00:00:13.195 --> 00:00:17.105
But it is still at the study stage,
and local Adi communities have protested.

00:00:17.361 --> 00:00:19.931
They fear villages and
farmland could be submerged.

00:00:20.306 --> 00:00:22.826
India also needs a data-sharing
agreement with China,

00:00:22.826 --> 00:00:25.896
and a plan for floods
and droughts downstream.

00:00:26.027 --> 00:00:28.957
A water story with no
easy villain: security,

00:00:29.586 --> 00:00:32.356
development and people's homes
all pull in different directions.

00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:34.362
Build the dam or protect the valley?

00:00:34.402 --> 00:00:35.472
Comment your side.

